Package: local.duobar
Name: DuoBar
Version: 2.7.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: An iPhone Duo-inspired status bar for iOS 16.
 A circular battery ring with a live percentage, compact 5G/LTE and Wi-Fi indicators, and four cellular signal dots.
 Includes charging and Low Power Mode colors, light and dark styling, an adjustable size slider, and an on/off switch in Settings.
 Developed by RBx9. X: @rmbx09.
Maintainer: RBx9
Author: RBx9
Homepage: https://github.com/RBx9/DuoBar
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 16.0), firmware (<< 17.0)
Tag: role::tweak
